n lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #282828; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"> 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 컨설팅대학원 : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">4학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #282828; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"> 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">4. 시험시간</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #282828; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 석사과정 : 19:00 ~ 21:30 [150분]</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #282828; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 박사과정 : 19:00 ~ 22:20 [200분]</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">5. 유의사항 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;가. 시험과목은 동일교수의 과목(석사 2과목, 박사 3과목 이내)만으로 시행할 수 없습니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; (불합격 과목 응시자는 합격한 내용 확인 후 시험 응시 신청하여야 함)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; ex) 석,박사과정 모두 문제출제 교수가 반드시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">2명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"> 이상이어야 함</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;나. 과목수를 학기별로 나누어 시행할 수 없습니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 석사는 3과목, 박사는 4과목 모두 신청하셔야 합니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (대학원 학위수여 규정 제2장 제5조 4항)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;다. 과목별 합격자의 경우 종전 불합격한 과목 외 다른 과목으로도 응시할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;라. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">본인 학과(전공)에서 출제된 과목 외에는 응시할 수 없습니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ 유의사항 : 졸업종합시험 및 외국어시험(일반 및 컨설팅) 합격자에 한하여</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 학위논문심사 신청가능</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">2016. 03.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
